OL,3,ATrump threatens to stop sale of
OL,4,ACanadian Bombardier jets in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move came amid an escalating trade
OL,7,Fwar between the two neighbours, and
OL,8,Fhours before Canadian retaliatory
OL,9,Ftariffs were imposed on $20bn (#14.7bn)
OL,10,Fof US goods.
OL,12,FIn a statement, Bombardier said it
OL,13,Femployed thousands of American workers
OL,14,Fand that it valued its partnerships
OL,15,Fwith US companies.
